repository-code: "https://github.com/QEC-Team/MGCI-Deep-Learning"
url: "https://github.com/QEC-Team/MGCI-Deep-Learning"
abstract: >-
  A deep learning framework for calculating the Mountain Green Cover Index 
  (MGCI) - UN SDG Indicator 15.4.2 - using U-Net semantic segmentation and 
  satellite remote sensing data. The framework is region-agnostic and can be 
  applied to any mountainous region worldwide using Google Earth Engine, 
  Sentinel-2 imagery, and Copernicus DEM data.
